    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "patience is hard when it feels like there's nothing to wait for. it's not just that i'm new, it's like i'm just a background character in everyone else's life. i look at people laughing or talking and i feel so far away. like nothing i do or say will ever actually matter to anyone. it feels so heavy.",
