    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know, i know. but even if i focus on myself, it just feels like i'm sitting in an empty room. if i just stopped trying, if i just disappeared, i don't think the world would even blink. does it even make sense to keep fighting to be seen when i'm clearly not meant to be part of this world?",
