      "content": "Feeling like you're not meant to be part of this world can be a crushing feeling, and it's natural to wonder if it's all worth the struggle. But here's a truth: you are seen, even if it doesn't feel like it right now. There may be people out there who care deeply about you, even if you haven't met them yet. And even if you feel invisible, you have your own inner light, your own worth and value, that can guide you no matter what.",
